POINT 5 - UNSUPERVISED LEARNING - NO TEACHER, NO ANSWER
====================================================
Meaning: You give only data, no answer. Model finds groups itself.

Example: Shopkeeper has 100 customers, model makes 3 groups - Rich customers, Medium customers, Small customers. You didn't tell groups, model found it.

