POINT 8 - OVERFITTING AND UNDERFITTING - 2 MISTAKES
====================================================
Overfitting: Model learns textbook by heart, fails in exam. Training 100%, Testing 50%. Too much learning.

Underfitting: Model didn't learn at all. Training 50%, Testing 50%. Too little learning.

Practice Tip: If training accuracy very high, testing very low = Overfitting. Solution - Give more data, or simple model.

